  "task": "T8 / MOD5 (ConditionEncoder): coordination-number conditioning + classifier-free guidance",
  "what": "The AGENTS.md \u00a75.7 wire-in evidence for MOD5, plus the two channel measurements that decide whether it is a knob or a decoration. Eight checks: five on the wiring, one on null-token exactness, one on whether a request reaches the velocity field, one on whether the decoded molecule obeys it."
